      "startDateApproximate": false,
      "endDateApproximate": false,
      "summary": "Claire Clairmont's journal shows Casa Silva still functioning as a regular Pisan base in October 1821: she spends 10 October there with Shelley, dines there on 19 October, reaches Pisa and the Tre Palazzi on 27 October by way of the same social circuit, and on 30 October leaves Pugnano to arrive at Casa Silva before rejoining the Shelleys in the city on 31 October.",
